{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_title", "source_sha256": "c6f61147b38c3ffb89633114fa81ed7cd3ef793e7284f6a3c6a739ff832e3edb", "ja": "ふるえるこころ", "zh": "颤抖的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bdb487cbbf65ff0b46dca6f4fe2cf2d71b731c74b29171ef8bed6320b437d322", "ja": "センターに指名された紬は、エミリー憧れの\n大和撫子。だが自分に自信が持てないせいで\n思わずエミリーを遠ざけてしまう。しかし、\nプロデューサーの後押しで仲間達と心を通わ\nせ、皆の力も借りて無事公演を成功に導く。", "zh": "被指名担任Center的䌷，是艾蜜莉憧憬的\n大和抚子。只是䌷却无法对自己抱持自信，\n因此不自觉地将艾蜜莉拒于门外。但在制作人\n的协助下，终于让䌷和同伴们相互了解，并顺\n利地借助大家的力量，让公演画下完美句点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff0982321576918bb1e1cdd85bfb94feea53cadae9747b680f878f7b13e37526", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。楽しんでるところ悪いんだけど、\nちょっと紬に話があるんだ。いいかな？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。不好意思打断你们聊天，\n但我有点事想和䌷说，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d473fb574b62ebc2b84eb7a3e95eb2013e6fb7166ed04bf3b8ab4af1c515e287", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。\nはい、お話というのは？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n好的，请问是什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "624e1f6692efdc923a3343ca7012c09174369b650ab64c7192789805bd985bc4", "ja": "いや、すぐ済む話なんだ。次の公演は、\n紬にセンターを任せることになった。頼むぞ！", "zh": "没什么，不是会占用太多时间的事。\n下次公演，我打算让䌷来担任Center。麻烦你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "4dc21c09ea3fda8e6ec1eab337c506efd7ce0ef26b22316fc5b6d44e1ff7dc23", "ja": "あら、すごいじゃない！\nおめでとう、紬ちゃん♪", "zh": "哎呀，很棒耶！\n恭喜你，小䌷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "51cafc8b3a1315c7510fa2ffa504d02e278145f05e12da4188b0cb6a3ed5e816", "ja": "おめでとうございます！　紬さんが主役となる舞台……\nきっと、とても雅で美しいものになりますね！", "zh": "恭喜你！由䌷姊姊当主角的表演……\n肯定会非常风雅又美丽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e5bea283b73ff156f15b78a1142436e5581bf443b8f9331600ea3e442500f671", "ja": "そ……っ。そんなん……！", "zh": "怎……怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "260a69e089aac0a6978273d0879a428889a2199855a08f6859c551c1a1ca9aa5", "ja": "紬ちゃん？", "zh": "小䌷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e9a0f9f7fe5c6e9a1a4acbb238ba25612fb88174ce58307e9f2703d8ca753d9c", "ja": "い、いえ……。わかりました。", "zh": "没、没事……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8cad327f0062c36a85e4632eab11bd8150b7b2f3052d31f3e49ad41a3a21598", "ja": "そういうことでしたら、早速レッスンに励まなくては\nいけませんね。それでは、ごめんあそばせ。", "zh": "既然如此，得赶快加紧练习才行。\n那么，我先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4f54f70b52a0dfe21b938ea58680dac44b9ac92a4e29f9bc9a7ad69e05aa415b", "ja": "（手放しで大喜び、とはいかなかったか。さて……）", "zh": "（她没有表现出欣喜若狂的样子呢。嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
